WEBVTT

01:40.380 --> 01:44.220
[A Moment But Forever]

01:45.140 --> 01:47.240
[Episode 28]

01:50.400 --> 01:51.200
Xue has to

01:51.200 --> 01:52.310
take care of both of you alone.

01:52.710 --> 01:54.070
It must be really tough.

01:54.840 --> 01:56.350
She is a very good person.

01:56.479 --> 01:57.680
I cherish her very much.

01:58.509 --> 02:00.560
You can say nice things to my face, you know.

02:00.640 --> 02:01.870
Saying them behind my back,

02:01.870 --> 02:03.310
I won't be able to hear them.

02:05.430 --> 02:06.400
Who did this?

02:06.840 --> 02:07.640
Qian Lin.

02:07.960 --> 02:09.080
It must be Qian Lin.

02:09.240 --> 02:10.910
He just hates my flowers.

02:11.190 --> 02:12.080
Where is he?

02:44.840 --> 02:45.630
Bravo!

02:46.750 --> 02:48.190
Not bad with your training.

02:49.200 --> 02:50.670
Hurry and hand out the dates to the children.

02:52.190 --> 02:53.680
Come here, kids.

02:54.040 --> 02:55.290
Come on, come on, have some dates.

02:55.870 --> 02:56.590
Slow down, slow down.

02:56.590 --> 02:57.860
Don't fight, don't fight, don't fight.

02:57.890 --> 02:58.430
Give me one.

02:58.430 --> 02:59.310
Okay, okay, okay.

02:59.329 --> 03:00.360
Take some more.

03:00.360 --> 03:00.710
Take more.

03:00.710 --> 03:01.310
I want some too.

03:01.310 --> 03:02.030
Thank you.

03:07.680 --> 03:09.080
Look how beautiful that cloud is.

03:09.340 --> 03:10.900
It looks like a majestic tiger.

03:11.310 --> 03:12.510
More like a paper tiger.

03:13.080 --> 03:13.870
When the wind blows,

03:14.310 --> 03:15.310
it'll be gone.

03:15.410 --> 03:16.810
You're such a killjoy.

03:18.000 --> 03:18.800
The truth

03:19.560 --> 03:20.360
is unpleasant.

03:25.480 --> 03:26.800
When I was in the tower ship,

03:26.910 --> 03:28.079
I never thought

03:28.120 --> 03:29.240
that one day

03:29.470 --> 03:31.430
I'd be able to watch clouds with someone

03:31.430 --> 03:33.000
at the door of my own house.

03:33.160 --> 03:34.350
I never thought either

03:35.470 --> 03:36.280
that this thing

03:37.400 --> 03:38.870
would be something people enjoy.

03:39.960 --> 03:40.630
You don't like it,

03:40.630 --> 03:41.840
but you're still watching it with me.

03:42.910 --> 03:44.800
And you don't hate me,

03:44.800 --> 03:45.520
right?

03:52.280 --> 03:55.000
Thank you for taking care of me these days.

04:01.030 --> 04:02.030
I'm grateful to you.

04:03.010 --> 04:04.000
Alright, alright, alright.

04:04.190 --> 04:04.960
Don't be in such a hurry

04:04.960 --> 04:05.910
to set boundaries with me.

04:05.910 --> 04:07.470
I know you like Tanyin.

04:11.150 --> 04:13.030
Why doesn't anyone like me?

04:15.910 --> 04:17.600
You just haven't met the right person yet.

04:18.959 --> 04:19.760
Right?

04:21.870 --> 04:23.000
I guess I'll wait a bit longer then.

04:28.240 --> 04:29.270
Look at that cloud.

04:29.720 --> 04:30.800
Doesn't it look like a fish?

04:31.000 --> 04:32.240
Braised fish, maybe.

04:32.680 --> 04:34.070
Can't it be steamed?

04:34.340 --> 04:35.110
No, wait.

04:35.140 --> 04:36.820
Why does it have to be cooked?

04:37.159 --> 04:39.159
I want a fish swimming in the river.

04:40.360 --> 04:41.159
Alright.

04:43.170 --> 04:44.210
Look at that cloud.

04:44.310 --> 04:45.680
Isn't it adorable?

04:46.140 --> 04:47.460
Doesn't it look just like my face?

04:52.680 --> 04:53.480
How are you feeling?

04:53.560 --> 04:55.430
Do you feel better after getting some fresh air?

04:56.040 --> 04:57.800
I've been feeling much better for a while now.

04:57.800 --> 04:58.800
Don't worry.

05:06.190 --> 05:08.520
You seem to be very happy here.

05:08.800 --> 05:09.600
Yes, indeed.

05:10.040 --> 05:12.430
Because I have Xue here.

05:12.830 --> 05:13.790
And Qian Lin.

05:14.950 --> 05:15.750
And also...

05:18.040 --> 05:18.870
And you.

05:22.190 --> 05:23.000
Tell me,

05:23.430 --> 05:25.750
do you think Qian Lin will fully recover?

05:31.040 --> 05:31.830
It's hard to say.

05:32.110 --> 05:32.920
Really?

05:36.310 --> 05:37.630
What if he becomes even better than before?

05:46.870 --> 05:48.240
I have an errand to run.

05:48.240 --> 05:49.510
You can continue practicing here.

05:59.320 --> 06:00.820
♫Ask the heavens♫

06:00.840 --> 06:02.720
♫I don't know why I'm without a home♫

06:02.740 --> 06:03.980
♫I'm at a dead end♫

06:04.000 --> 06:05.800
♫And I have to surrender and accept my destiny♫

06:05.820 --> 06:07.550
♫I'm the wandering one♫

06:07.610 --> 06:09.410
♫My body and mind, falling into dust♫

06:09.440 --> 06:11.440
♫Only the moon in the sky♫

06:11.460 --> 06:12.950
♫Shines upon the lifelong decay♫

06:12.980 --> 06:15.080
♫The scars you can't see♫

06:15.110 --> 06:16.980
♫Are the proof of my struggle♫

06:17.020 --> 06:18.770
♫Be your own last straw of hope♫

06:18.800 --> 06:20.470
♫Why do you have to go alone?♫

06:20.500 --> 06:22.070
♫Let me learn to be fearless♫

06:22.090 --> 06:23.770
♫I live with no regrets♫

06:23.800 --> 06:25.160
♫Who deserves to be crushed?♫

06:25.190 --> 06:27.690
♫Don't tell me what's right or wrong♫

06:31.040 --> 06:32.240
Your staff technique is good.

06:35.390 --> 06:36.190
You know about staff techniques?

06:36.600 --> 06:37.390
Not really.

06:37.830 --> 06:39.430
But I can see some intricacies in it.

06:39.920 --> 06:41.430
Was it taught by a master?

06:43.600 --> 06:44.480
I suppose so.

06:45.720 --> 06:46.510
Not bad.

06:46.750 --> 06:48.159
It's a pity it was taught to the wrong person.

06:49.360 --> 06:50.159
Stop right there.

06:52.750 --> 06:54.040
What do you mean by that?

06:55.000 --> 06:55.870
What I mean is,

06:56.360 --> 06:57.750
although the staff technique is exquisite,

06:58.000 --> 06:59.430
you've only learned the form

06:59.480 --> 07:00.870
without grasping its essence.

07:04.310 --> 07:05.390
That's quite a bold statement.

07:06.270 --> 07:08.000
Didn't you say you don't know about staff techniques?

07:08.240 --> 07:10.040
Does one need to be a chef

07:10.360 --> 07:11.720
to judge the quality of a dish?

07:11.720 --> 07:12.870
Who are you calling a chef?

07:14.590 --> 07:15.790
It's hard to explain to you.

07:18.240 --> 07:19.360
Did I say you could leave?

07:19.630 --> 07:21.360
Seems like you haven't learned your lesson.

07:23.080 --> 07:24.030
You helped me.

07:24.270 --> 07:25.240
I remember that.

07:25.290 --> 07:26.770
But that's a separate matter.

07:27.240 --> 07:29.560
You can't leave without explaining yourself.

07:30.000 --> 07:32.040
What's the matter? Getting anxious?

07:32.310 --> 07:33.720
Do you think being a chef is shameful?

07:33.960 --> 07:35.710
You War Demons grew up eating dirt.

07:36.500 --> 07:38.180
You think being a chef is easy?

07:38.330 --> 07:39.330
Being a chef

07:39.480 --> 07:41.159
requires understanding fire and seasoning,

07:41.270 --> 07:42.510
knowing when to add ingredients,

07:42.510 --> 07:43.630
when to take them out,

07:43.680 --> 07:45.830
balancing rich broths and delicate flavors,

07:45.850 --> 07:47.020
achieving the right color,

07:47.050 --> 07:48.810
and mastering every aspect with precision.

07:49.270 --> 07:50.159
Can you do that?

07:50.630 --> 07:52.800
It's not easy to perfect

07:52.820 --> 07:54.380
anything in this world.

07:56.000 --> 07:57.240
For a War Demon,

07:57.490 --> 07:59.850
is it so difficult to ask for guidance?

08:02.040 --> 08:03.190
There's more to what you're saying.

08:03.510 --> 08:05.190
Do you have a way to help me?

08:06.000 --> 08:06.800
I do.

08:07.630 --> 08:08.600
What will it take for you to tell me?

08:08.810 --> 08:10.130
Do you want me to kneel and beg?

08:10.160 --> 08:11.650
Just say, "Please teach me."

08:11.950 --> 08:13.070
What can you teach me?

08:13.070 --> 08:14.600
That depends on what you want to learn.

08:18.870 --> 08:19.680
Alright.

08:20.270 --> 08:21.070
Please teach me.

08:22.630 --> 08:23.430
What did you say?

08:23.790 --> 08:25.640
Your voice was too soft. I couldn't hear.

08:28.750 --> 08:29.830
Please teach me.

08:30.150 --> 08:31.390
You're asking for me to teach you?

08:31.930 --> 08:32.840
Teach you what?

08:34.440 --> 08:35.320
Please teach me,

08:35.320 --> 08:36.600
whom you just restored the magic source of,

08:36.870 --> 08:37.789
how I can return

08:37.789 --> 08:39.080
to my previous state

08:39.230 --> 08:40.230
so that I can take revenge.

08:42.600 --> 08:43.390
Very well.

08:43.720 --> 08:45.000
Then I need an attitude from you.

08:56.510 --> 08:57.720
Please enlighten me.

09:00.120 --> 09:01.030
It's simple.

09:01.600 --> 09:03.390
Let go of your so-called prejudices

09:03.840 --> 09:05.200
and unnecessary pride.

09:05.630 --> 09:06.910
Be a good chef.

09:07.200 --> 09:07.960
You're toying with me.

09:07.960 --> 09:09.000
I haven't finished.

09:10.000 --> 09:10.790
Speak!

09:11.720 --> 09:12.960
In this vast world,

09:13.080 --> 09:14.630
culinary skills are inexhaustible.

09:15.240 --> 09:16.440
As I said,

09:16.720 --> 09:18.440
if you want to be a top chef,

09:18.910 --> 09:20.960
you need to experience all kinds of cuisines

09:21.200 --> 09:23.200
and learn from renowned masters.

09:23.670 --> 09:24.910
But if you want to be

09:24.910 --> 09:26.200
a good chef in chaotic times,

09:26.840 --> 09:27.910
you don't need to be bound by

09:27.910 --> 09:29.440
so many rules and regulations.

09:30.000 --> 09:31.870
A good chef in chaotic times...

09:32.550 --> 09:33.360
What do I do?

09:33.510 --> 09:34.960
Let go of all tricks.

09:35.670 --> 09:37.080
As long as what you make

09:37.510 --> 09:39.320
can fill the stomachs of hungry people,

09:39.750 --> 09:41.360
you are a good chef.

09:44.240 --> 09:45.200
I don't understand.

09:46.390 --> 09:47.670
Who a good chef is,

09:48.150 --> 09:49.600
is decided by the diners.

09:49.910 --> 09:51.790
There aren't so many rules that must be followed.

09:51.910 --> 09:52.720
So?

09:52.720 --> 09:53.480
So,

09:54.260 --> 09:56.290
who decides who can become

09:57.120 --> 09:58.790
a perfect War Demon?

10:00.400 --> 10:01.970
I've never thought about that.

10:02.240 --> 10:03.270
Maybe it's

10:03.700 --> 10:05.390
the fortune of the War Demon ancestors

10:05.410 --> 10:06.440
and their recognition.

10:06.840 --> 10:09.080
Who says there's only one way

10:09.380 --> 10:10.850
to be recognized by ancestral fortune?

10:36.550 --> 10:37.360
Young City Lord.

10:39.630 --> 10:42.480
Where is that Youhu scoundrel?

10:43.320 --> 10:44.790
We've already sent scouts to watch him.

10:45.170 --> 10:46.960
Tang is now in the inn.

10:47.550 --> 10:48.480
No movement for now.

10:50.510 --> 10:51.680
Should we forcefully kill him?

10:52.750 --> 10:53.670
No need.

10:54.320 --> 10:55.360
Just keep watching him.

10:55.790 --> 10:57.870
He's the commander of the Youhu Clan's War Division.

10:57.890 --> 10:58.980
His strength is considerable.

10:59.900 --> 11:01.900
It won't be easy to kill him.

11:02.870 --> 11:04.320
Even without the commotion it would cause,

11:04.780 --> 11:06.490
if he managed to escape,

11:07.480 --> 11:09.270
it would alert our enemies.

11:09.650 --> 11:11.770
Then, just keep watching?

11:16.960 --> 11:18.840
He has a close relationship with Zhi Dai.

11:19.030 --> 11:20.270
He probably won't hide it from her

11:20.270 --> 11:21.510
and report the matter.

11:21.860 --> 11:23.220
At least not now.

11:24.550 --> 11:26.080
The time we've gained

11:26.100 --> 11:27.320
should be enough.

11:28.670 --> 11:30.270
He's no longer important.

11:31.790 --> 11:33.080
What about the other two?

11:34.600 --> 11:35.720
We've positioned people

11:36.600 --> 11:37.720
around Young Mistress Dai.

11:38.270 --> 11:40.910
City Lord...

11:40.910 --> 11:41.550
Speak.

11:44.030 --> 11:45.000
The City Lord

11:45.960 --> 11:48.890
removed all soldiers from outside the room.

11:49.790 --> 11:50.600
Okay.

11:52.390 --> 11:53.840
Quickly prepare the wine.

11:54.200 --> 11:55.010
Young City Lord,

11:56.240 --> 11:57.720
do you really want to do this?

11:58.320 --> 11:59.150
Some things,

11:59.600 --> 12:00.550
once done,

12:00.670 --> 12:02.150
are hard to undo.

12:15.750 --> 12:17.150
I have already

12:19.790 --> 12:21.760
reached the point of no return.

12:35.510 --> 12:36.510
What is it?

12:40.080 --> 12:41.480
I apologize for disturbing your seclusion, Father.

12:42.480 --> 12:44.870
Please forgive me.

12:46.080 --> 12:47.270
Ah, it's Yue.

12:47.840 --> 12:49.080
What brings you here?

12:50.200 --> 12:51.000
Father,

12:51.160 --> 12:52.560
Dai has returned.

12:53.000 --> 12:54.320
She brought news

12:54.840 --> 12:56.200
that the fox clan's immortal medicine

12:56.630 --> 12:57.510
must be accompanied by

12:57.510 --> 12:59.480
their specially made immortal wine

12:59.600 --> 13:01.170
for the effects to last.

13:02.000 --> 13:03.430
I didn't dare delay,

13:04.390 --> 13:05.960
so I specially obtained this wine

13:06.630 --> 13:07.910
to bring to you.

13:07.910 --> 13:09.790
You are thoughtful, my son.

13:41.700 --> 13:43.080
I'm done. You can take it away.

13:43.320 --> 13:44.120
Yes.

13:49.120 --> 13:49.960
Is there something else?

13:50.510 --> 13:51.870
N-Nothing.

14:05.670 --> 14:06.480
How dare you!

14:09.930 --> 14:10.890
The food was poisoned.

14:11.080 --> 14:11.870
Indeed.

14:12.270 --> 14:13.480
The Young City Lord calculated well.

14:13.960 --> 14:15.270
You've already been poisoned with a power-sealing toxin.

14:15.510 --> 14:16.870
Surrender obediently now.

14:18.850 --> 14:20.450
It's Zhi Yue who wants to arrest me, isn't it?

14:20.960 --> 14:22.030
Acting like this

14:22.080 --> 14:23.200
is no different from rebellion.

14:23.630 --> 14:25.270
My father would never forgive you.

14:25.600 --> 14:26.750
The rebel is you!

14:27.240 --> 14:28.080
All units, attention!

14:28.790 --> 14:30.000
The City Lord has died suddenly.

14:30.270 --> 14:31.750
Young Mistress Dai is under heavy suspicion.

14:32.360 --> 14:33.320
Arrest her immediately!

14:33.320 --> 14:34.000
Yes, sir!

14:45.440 --> 14:46.910
Qian Lin is meditating outside.

14:46.910 --> 14:48.240
Why has he been sitting there for so long?

14:48.630 --> 14:49.550
Don't worry about him.

14:50.630 --> 14:51.440
But...

14:52.120 --> 14:52.960
It's fine.

14:53.120 --> 14:54.670
I just gave him a little guidance.

14:57.360 --> 14:58.840
Thank you, Yuanzhong.

15:00.200 --> 15:01.980
There's no need for thanks between us.

15:02.330 --> 15:03.500
He's your good friend,

15:03.610 --> 15:04.570
so of course I'll treat him

15:04.590 --> 15:05.680
as a close bodyguard.

15:05.750 --> 15:07.120
It's normal to look after him.

15:07.480 --> 15:08.440
He doesn't want to be

15:08.440 --> 15:09.600
your bodyguard at all.

15:09.750 --> 15:10.960
If he hears you say that,

15:10.960 --> 15:12.320
he'll get angry again.

15:13.910 --> 15:15.670
Aren't you afraid of making me angry?

15:16.960 --> 15:18.030
Of course not.

15:22.080 --> 15:23.390
Let's play a game.

15:23.670 --> 15:25.150
It's very popular in the Mortal Realm recently.

15:28.080 --> 15:29.550
Do you see that hook?

15:29.630 --> 15:31.360
We'll try to throw this ring over it.

15:31.480 --> 15:32.270
The person who loses

15:32.270 --> 15:33.270
can grant the winner

15:33.270 --> 15:34.000
a wish.

15:34.000 --> 15:35.030
They can accumulate, you know.

15:38.900 --> 15:40.610
Is this game really from the Mortal Realm?

15:41.150 --> 15:42.240
Where did you see it?

15:42.360 --> 15:44.030
Why are you asking so many questions?

15:44.150 --> 15:45.150
Let me show you how it's done.

15:51.440 --> 15:52.240
Come on, hurry.

15:57.320 --> 15:58.870
It's okay, try again.

16:04.510 --> 16:05.320
Watch me.

16:12.840 --> 16:13.630
It's your turn.

16:26.270 --> 16:27.670
It must be because the hook I made

16:27.670 --> 16:28.750
isn't curved enough.

16:28.790 --> 16:29.550
Next time, I'll make you

16:29.550 --> 16:30.790
a better one.

16:35.510 --> 16:36.240
Why do I feel like

16:36.240 --> 16:37.600
you're toying with me?

16:37.750 --> 16:38.550
I'm not.

16:42.270 --> 16:43.080
Don't go.

16:43.390 --> 16:44.240
Don't be angry.

16:44.510 --> 16:45.720
I'm not angry.

16:46.210 --> 16:47.380
I'm just going to pick up the things.

16:48.150 --> 16:49.080
You don't need to pick them up.

16:49.390 --> 16:50.200
I'll do it.

16:50.870 --> 16:52.390
Why aren't you taking this seriously?

16:52.790 --> 16:54.360
I've worked on this for a long time.

16:56.030 --> 16:57.440
Because I don't need to win.

17:02.670 --> 17:03.480
Because...

17:05.680 --> 17:06.720
Because I want

17:07.829 --> 17:09.400
to fulfill all your wishes.

17:17.079 --> 17:19.869
♫Too many old dreams♫

17:20.319 --> 17:23.329
♫Where did the snow fall to?♫

17:24.119 --> 17:27.960
♫Going to face a catastrophe♫

17:27.980 --> 17:30.810
♫No one is irrelevant♫

17:34.400 --> 17:37.070
♫A slight ripple in my gaze♫

17:37.330 --> 17:40.820
♫Who knows the warmth and cold of my fleeting life?♫

17:41.680 --> 17:45.500
♫If staying together is difficult, it's not worth it♫

17:45.530 --> 17:48.560
♫I'll return what's left of my life♫

17:49.830 --> 17:51.830
♫Falling into the mortal world♫

17:52.000 --> 17:54.000
♫Wandering through the clouds and rivers♫

17:54.310 --> 17:58.080
♫Being by your side is like finding the shore♫

17:58.410 --> 18:00.410
♫If between oaths♫

18:00.690 --> 18:02.490
♫I hold onto the longing for just one more glance♫

18:02.740 --> 18:06.320
♫Unwilling to bid farewell for good♫

18:06.990 --> 18:09.380
♫Tears grow cold in a single cup♫

18:09.400 --> 18:11.680
♫Longing fades in half♫

18:11.700 --> 18:15.880
♫Like flowers in a mirror, or the moon in the water♫

18:16.400 --> 18:23.450
♫The lonely guest can't sleep, destiny can't be undone; speechless♫

18:24.750 --> 18:26.990
♫Falling into the mortal world♫

18:27.010 --> 18:29.080
♫Wandering through the clouds and rivers♫

18:29.280 --> 18:33.030
♫Being by your side is like finding the shore♫

18:33.360 --> 18:35.530
♫The moon falls by the riverbank♫

18:35.560 --> 18:37.710
♫The light finally dims♫

18:37.730 --> 18:41.710
♫How can my heart be at ease?♫

18:42.030 --> 18:44.420
♫Tears grow cold in a single cup♫

18:44.450 --> 18:46.450
♫Longing fades in half♫

18:46.500 --> 18:50.950
♫Like flowers in a mirror, or the moon in the water♫

18:51.260 --> 19:01.150
♫The lonely guest can't sleep, destiny can't be undone; speechless♫

19:15.110 --> 19:15.920
Qian Lin?

19:17.480 --> 19:18.270
Qian Lin!

19:19.200 --> 19:20.240
What's wrong with him?

19:20.440 --> 19:21.640
He's not doing breath-holding too, is he?

19:22.000 --> 19:23.550
It's alright, he's just practicing his skills.

19:23.550 --> 19:24.790
Let's not disturb him.

19:25.000 --> 19:25.920
Come on, let's go first.

19:31.310 --> 19:32.110
Tanyin.

19:32.470 --> 19:33.920
You've been shopping for a long time.

19:33.960 --> 19:35.510
What exactly do you want to buy?

19:35.790 --> 19:36.880
I want to buy some fabric

19:36.880 --> 19:38.070
and some silk thread.

19:39.310 --> 19:40.580
I know where to find good materials,

19:40.610 --> 19:41.610
and they're affordable too.

19:42.350 --> 19:43.270
I remember it's over there.

19:43.270 --> 19:44.350
Come on, I'll take you there.

19:44.920 --> 19:45.720
Tanyin.

19:47.440 --> 19:48.240
Tanyin?

20:33.240 --> 20:34.030
I didn't expect this.

20:34.880 --> 20:36.030
I really didn't expect

20:36.720 --> 20:40.070
that the god of the Youhu Clan has become a demon.

20:40.730 --> 20:43.580
Even without becoming a demon, I can still kill you.

20:52.960 --> 20:53.830
Having become a demon,

20:54.960 --> 20:56.510
I can still spare your miserable life.

20:57.480 --> 21:00.030
You were there that night, weren't you?

21:01.070 --> 21:02.200
You saw everything?

21:05.480 --> 21:06.310
You're so afraid,

21:07.070 --> 21:08.030
yet you still dared to come here.

21:09.200 --> 21:11.440
Dingxu, you've got some brains.

21:11.720 --> 21:12.680
In this world,

21:13.240 --> 21:15.270
there are plenty of cold-hearted, greedy,

21:15.550 --> 21:17.240
stubborn, and unrepentant individuals.

21:17.720 --> 21:19.790
Those as evil as you

21:20.510 --> 21:21.590
all deserve to die.

21:22.200 --> 21:23.000
Therefore,

21:23.240 --> 21:25.590
I once thought of using the power of the Divine Hand

21:25.690 --> 21:27.010
to bring down divine punishment

21:28.160 --> 21:29.270
and make this world

21:29.510 --> 21:31.400
completely pure and righteous again.

21:31.880 --> 21:32.920
At that time,

21:33.380 --> 21:34.660
people like you

21:35.510 --> 21:36.750
would all disappear.

21:38.750 --> 21:39.640
Demon!

21:40.920 --> 21:42.400
How can you do this?

21:43.240 --> 21:44.590
Whether I would do this or not,

21:45.350 --> 21:47.260
don't you know better than anyone else?

21:48.440 --> 21:49.240
However,

21:50.480 --> 21:52.400
I don't plan to do that anymore.

21:54.960 --> 21:55.810
Is that so?

21:56.440 --> 21:57.240
Yes.

21:58.400 --> 21:59.680
You're in your twilight years,

21:59.880 --> 22:01.550
and you have no Blood Pills left to use.

22:01.960 --> 22:03.920
You don't have many days left to live anyway.

22:04.750 --> 22:07.550
So I can't be bothered to kill you myself.

22:07.960 --> 22:08.750
But

22:09.200 --> 22:10.160
if you dare

22:10.160 --> 22:12.590
to sneak around behind my back again

22:13.160 --> 22:15.000
and do some disrespectful things,

22:16.110 --> 22:18.240
I won't mind shortening

22:18.590 --> 22:19.790
your lifespan even further.

22:20.590 --> 22:23.110
Do you understand?

22:26.310 --> 22:27.110
Go now.

22:27.680 --> 22:29.780
Hide where I can't see you.

22:36.790 --> 22:37.680
Ladies.

22:37.980 --> 22:38.950
Shopkeeper, bring some silk thread.

22:38.980 --> 22:40.200
I'll choose some fabric too.

22:40.200 --> 22:40.960
Alright!

22:42.000 --> 22:42.790
Tanyin,

22:42.920 --> 22:44.070
I noticed you don't have many clothes.

22:44.070 --> 22:45.750
Are you making new clothes for yourself?

22:45.880 --> 22:47.400
Having enough clothes to wear is fine.

22:47.400 --> 22:47.960
I saw that

22:47.960 --> 22:49.270
Yuanzhong's robe was damaged,

22:49.270 --> 22:50.830
so I want to make him a new one.

22:51.510 --> 22:53.470
You are so nice to the High Priest.

22:54.720 --> 22:55.590
Did you

22:55.590 --> 22:57.110
bring his measurements with you?

22:57.110 --> 22:58.590
How much fabric do we need to buy?

22:58.880 --> 22:59.830
Have you forgotten?

22:59.830 --> 23:00.880
I'm a craftsman.

23:01.200 --> 23:02.550
I can tell at a glance.

23:02.590 --> 23:03.750
The measurements

23:03.750 --> 23:04.720
are right here.

23:05.400 --> 23:06.080
Shopkeeper,

23:06.240 --> 23:07.200
please cut 10 meters

23:07.200 --> 23:07.880
of this fabric

23:07.880 --> 23:08.790
and match it with some silk thread.

23:08.790 --> 23:09.920
Remember to pack them up.

23:09.960 --> 23:10.750
Alright!

23:14.480 --> 23:15.270
Tanyin,

23:16.110 --> 23:17.590
shall we go back now?

23:18.110 --> 23:18.920
What's wrong?

23:19.240 --> 23:20.070
Are you tired from shopping?

23:21.000 --> 23:21.790
No.

23:22.440 --> 23:23.970
But when we came out,

23:24.000 --> 23:25.640
we didn't tell the High Priest.

23:25.790 --> 23:26.960
If he finds out

23:26.960 --> 23:28.270
that you went out while you're sick,

23:28.270 --> 23:29.560
he'll definitely be upset.

23:29.750 --> 23:31.270
Why are you so afraid of him?

23:31.270 --> 23:32.590
Of course I'm afraid.

23:32.830 --> 23:33.590
Aren't you?

23:33.590 --> 23:34.880
I think you're afraid too.

23:38.440 --> 23:39.240
Good morning.

23:39.440 --> 23:40.680
Didn't I tell you

23:40.830 --> 23:41.810
not to go out yet?

23:41.960 --> 23:43.160
I told you too

23:44.000 --> 23:45.200
that I'm already better.

23:50.400 --> 23:52.320
High Priest, why did you come out?

23:52.480 --> 23:53.430
I came out to find you two.

24:13.160 --> 24:14.030
Alright.

24:15.790 --> 24:16.590
Fine.

24:16.910 --> 24:18.540
Remember to tell me in advance next time.

24:18.590 --> 24:19.510
I got it.

24:29.410 --> 24:30.590
Can you help her for a while?

24:30.590 --> 24:31.880
I'll go inside and work for a bit.

24:32.200 --> 24:33.070
What are you doing?

24:34.400 --> 24:35.200
High Priest.

24:35.750 --> 24:36.750
Give me the fish.

24:36.750 --> 24:37.830
I'll go clean it.

24:37.990 --> 24:39.030
Then what should I do?

24:40.640 --> 24:41.880
High Priest, if it's convenient,

24:41.880 --> 24:43.660
could you help me start the fire?

24:44.000 --> 24:44.960
Thank you, High Priest.

24:49.110 --> 24:49.920
Move aside.

24:50.880 --> 24:51.680
Move aside.

24:54.310 --> 24:55.240
Move aside, move aside.

25:08.030 --> 25:08.830
Yuanzhong!

25:09.680 --> 25:10.480
Yuanzhong.

25:12.240 --> 25:12.920
What's the matter?

25:12.920 --> 25:14.240
Quickly look at this.

25:15.550 --> 25:16.310
Did you make this?

25:16.310 --> 25:17.030
Yes, I did.

25:17.510 --> 25:18.510
You made it just now?

25:18.510 --> 25:19.550
Yes, just now.

25:20.440 --> 25:21.960
That's so fast. Let me see.

25:22.410 --> 25:23.930
This isn't even considered fast.

25:23.960 --> 25:25.120
I saw that your clothes were damaged.

25:25.160 --> 25:26.790
I've been wanting to make you a new one.

25:26.810 --> 25:27.790
I just took apart the sleeves

25:27.790 --> 25:28.400
and remade them.

25:28.400 --> 25:29.790
Otherwise, it would have been even faster.

25:30.110 --> 25:31.200
Come on, let's go try it on.

25:42.880 --> 25:43.920
When will my love

25:43.920 --> 25:46.070
bloom?

26:26.740 --> 26:27.910
Turn around and let me see.

26:37.790 --> 26:38.640
Isn't this...

26:39.480 --> 26:40.350
I bought this for you

26:40.350 --> 26:41.640
a while ago.

26:41.660 --> 26:43.380
You were angry with me then,

26:43.480 --> 26:45.070
so I never got to put it on you.

26:48.550 --> 26:49.350
Ji Tanyin,

26:50.680 --> 26:51.480
I promise

26:52.200 --> 26:53.790
I'll never get angry with you again.

26:56.640 --> 26:57.290
Really.

27:00.070 --> 27:01.110
What does "oh" mean?

27:02.070 --> 27:03.550
It means I got it.

27:08.370 --> 27:09.400
It looks quite nice.

27:09.750 --> 27:11.240
I think it looks nice too.

27:19.570 --> 27:20.530
It's wonderful.

27:21.400 --> 27:22.200
What is?

27:24.110 --> 27:25.200
To be cared for

27:26.750 --> 27:27.550
is wonderful.

28:44.670 --> 28:45.750
How's your wound?

28:46.510 --> 28:47.310
It's nothing.

28:47.330 --> 28:48.400
Zhi Yue did it.

28:49.310 --> 28:50.240
As expected.

28:50.810 --> 28:51.960
Shall we go find him now?

28:51.990 --> 28:53.680
No, we're going to see the High Priest.

28:53.850 --> 28:55.370
Jiuguang has found his whereabouts.

29:09.330 --> 29:10.130
Young City Lord.

29:11.400 --> 29:12.100
What is it?

29:12.220 --> 29:13.980
Young Mistress Dai has been taken by the Youhu Clan.

29:14.210 --> 29:15.100
Are you sure?

29:15.720 --> 29:16.920
It was the Youhu Clan?

29:16.940 --> 29:18.340
The news just came in.

29:18.430 --> 29:19.430
It's absolutely certain.

29:19.680 --> 29:20.830
If the Youhu Clan and Young Mistress Dai

29:20.830 --> 29:21.720
come together

29:21.830 --> 29:23.350
to attend the old City Lord's funeral,

29:23.870 --> 29:24.660
then we...

29:27.090 --> 29:28.570
Quickly, bring me my token.

29:29.350 --> 29:30.200
I need to send a message to

29:30.200 --> 29:32.400
Li Chaoyang, Chief of the War Demons.

29:32.510 --> 29:33.310
Hurry!

29:33.330 --> 29:34.130
Yes, sir.

29:35.020 --> 29:35.830
Is anyone there?

29:36.510 --> 29:37.110
Is anyone there?

29:37.110 --> 29:37.830
Coming!

29:43.860 --> 29:45.180
Who are you looking for?

29:45.510 --> 29:46.590
We're looking for the High Priest.

29:50.510 --> 29:52.240
You said Zhi Yue killed his father?

29:53.030 --> 29:53.830
That's correct.

29:54.720 --> 29:56.350
I've already sent word back to our clan.

29:56.730 --> 29:58.100
Not only did Zhi Yue commit patricide,

29:58.400 --> 30:00.240
but he's also in cahoots with the War Demons.

30:01.480 --> 30:02.790
The reason why the War Demons have

30:02.790 --> 30:04.880
remained influential despite their decline

30:05.750 --> 30:07.640
is thanks to the help of the Wushuang Chamber of Commerce.

30:08.310 --> 30:10.030
And the person behind this sinister Wushuang Chamber of Commerce

30:10.310 --> 30:12.240
is none other than Zhi Yue.

30:12.640 --> 30:14.470
This man has been plotting among the human race for a long time.

30:14.920 --> 30:16.720
He's eyeing our Youhu Clan.

30:17.240 --> 30:19.310
A catastrophe seems inevitable.

30:20.160 --> 30:21.240
Zhi Dai originally wanted to persuade Zhi Yue

30:21.240 --> 30:22.270
to return to the right path

30:22.680 --> 30:23.920
but ended up being held under house arrest by him instead.

30:24.880 --> 30:26.030
Fortunately, I sent Jiuguang in advance

30:26.030 --> 30:27.070
to keep an eye on this matter

30:27.280 --> 30:28.450
and rescued her.

30:28.720 --> 30:30.510
Three days from now is the City Lord's grand funeral.

30:30.890 --> 30:32.570
By then, the new City Lord will take office.

30:33.000 --> 30:33.750
If Zhi Yue is allowed

30:33.750 --> 30:35.330
to ascend to the position of Yandu City Lord,

30:35.790 --> 30:36.830
then the situation of both

30:37.350 --> 30:38.590
the human race and the Youhu Clan

30:38.590 --> 30:39.640
will be in grave danger.

30:40.200 --> 30:41.830
I have sent a letter to Elder Xinyao.

30:42.160 --> 30:43.160
She replied saying

30:43.240 --> 30:44.070
Baili Xiang will bring

30:44.070 --> 30:45.160
the soldiers of the Youhu Clan

30:45.160 --> 30:46.200
and rush here overnight.

30:46.640 --> 30:47.440
Yuanzhong,

30:47.880 --> 30:49.240
what are your plans for this matter?

30:54.270 --> 30:55.070
Yuanzhong,

30:55.960 --> 30:57.200
given the current situation,

30:57.920 --> 30:58.720
you won't also

30:58.720 --> 30:59.960
stand idly by this time, will you?

31:05.030 --> 31:07.590
The way you said "also" is really...

31:11.110 --> 31:12.680
She was a handmaiden from Fangwai Mountain,

31:12.790 --> 31:13.590
right?

31:14.920 --> 31:15.720
Yes.

31:16.440 --> 31:17.350
Those years, Zhi Dai

31:17.350 --> 31:18.920
went up the mountain for my sake.

31:19.350 --> 31:20.830
In the end, I let her down.

31:21.240 --> 31:22.720
Now that she's in this predicament,

31:23.680 --> 31:25.240
I must protect her at all costs.

31:26.070 --> 31:26.880
Tanghua,

31:28.310 --> 31:30.310
someone just told me recently

31:31.070 --> 31:32.200
that this world is vast.

31:32.960 --> 31:34.550
It's not just about the petty interests,

31:34.570 --> 31:35.520
conflicts, and struggles

31:35.540 --> 31:37.300
of the Youhu Clan, the War Demon Clan,

31:37.330 --> 31:38.810
or the human race.

31:39.000 --> 31:40.270
There are many other places

31:40.290 --> 31:41.490
worth visiting,

31:42.070 --> 31:43.310
many sights

31:43.960 --> 31:45.160
worth seeing.

31:48.200 --> 31:49.000
However,

31:50.070 --> 31:51.880
since this is your matter, Tanghua...

31:55.160 --> 31:56.070
I naturally have no reason

31:56.070 --> 31:57.270
to not get involved.

32:23.270 --> 32:24.720
Are your injuries serious?

32:25.680 --> 32:26.480
It's nothing.

32:28.440 --> 32:29.550
When I came down the mountain,

32:30.100 --> 32:31.330
I thought you were dead.

32:33.400 --> 32:34.270
I didn't know

32:34.270 --> 32:35.880
you were the human Young Mistress of Yandu.

32:36.480 --> 32:37.720
Seeing you alive

32:37.960 --> 32:38.750
is truly wonderful.

32:39.600 --> 32:40.710
People come and go,

32:40.740 --> 32:41.780
gather and part.

32:41.960 --> 32:43.030
It's all in due time.

32:43.440 --> 32:45.880
Just like how the sun, moon, and stars take turns,

32:45.900 --> 32:46.870
life goes on endlessly.

32:47.310 --> 32:49.110
Although your father has passed away,

32:49.720 --> 32:51.130
he always thought of you,

32:51.590 --> 32:52.960
and you always thought of him.

32:53.550 --> 32:54.790
This is the fulfillment

32:54.790 --> 32:56.160
of your father-daughter relationship in this life.

32:56.830 --> 32:57.680
I understand.

32:58.360 --> 32:59.600
Thank you, Ji Tanyin.

33:05.510 --> 33:06.440
Young Mistress Dai,

33:07.160 --> 33:08.640
I understand your concerns,

33:09.200 --> 33:10.830
and I'm willing to lend you a hand.

33:11.200 --> 33:12.200
But you must know

33:12.480 --> 33:14.750
that there'll surely be a fierce battle when the time comes.

33:16.640 --> 33:17.590
I'm prepared

33:17.630 --> 33:18.910
for all possibilities.

33:19.960 --> 33:20.920
That's good then.

33:21.270 --> 33:22.640
Your willingness to help

33:22.830 --> 33:24.960
is deeply appreciated by the human race.

33:27.250 --> 33:28.300
Thank you, High Priest.

33:30.240 --> 33:31.030
Please rise.

33:32.780 --> 33:33.580
Get up quickly.

33:35.350 --> 33:36.790
Zhi Yue's actions

33:36.850 --> 33:38.810
are no longer just the internal affairs of the human race.

33:39.830 --> 33:40.590
Since I am still

33:40.590 --> 33:41.960
the High Priest of the Youhu Clan,

33:42.640 --> 33:44.200
I can't just stand by and do nothing.

34:03.440 --> 34:04.920
You haven't eaten much at all.

34:05.790 --> 34:06.840
I've made some sweet soup.

34:07.510 --> 34:08.510
Drink it while it's hot.

34:21.760 --> 34:22.550
Is there anything else

34:22.550 --> 34:23.590
I can do for you?

34:29.550 --> 34:30.590
I've also experienced

34:30.590 --> 34:32.110
the pain of losing loved ones,

34:33.380 --> 34:34.449
so I understand

34:35.550 --> 34:36.440
that at times like these,

34:37.320 --> 34:38.510
no matter who it is

34:39.370 --> 34:41.290
or what they say, it's all useless.

34:42.510 --> 34:43.630
You just want to be alone

34:43.630 --> 34:44.480
and have some quiet time.

34:47.000 --> 34:48.400
Whether it's having a good cry

34:49.440 --> 34:50.710
or getting drunk,

34:52.440 --> 34:53.230
the point is,

34:54.150 --> 34:55.760
don't keep it all bottled up inside.

35:08.360 --> 35:09.360
I'll be right outside the door.

35:10.230 --> 35:11.310
I'll always be here.

35:43.710 --> 35:44.510
Grand Elder,

35:44.880 --> 35:45.800
I'll go find a doctor for you.

35:45.800 --> 35:46.280
Wait for me.

35:46.280 --> 35:47.800
It's useless, useless.

35:49.880 --> 35:50.760
Yuanzhong.

35:52.460 --> 35:53.310
Blood Pill.

35:53.520 --> 35:54.330
Blood Pill?

35:54.800 --> 35:55.590
Blood Pill.

35:55.730 --> 35:57.400
Do I still have one?

35:59.460 --> 36:01.540
Yes, I do.

36:01.710 --> 36:03.510
Alright, I'll go get it.

36:31.240 --> 36:32.240
Mr. Tanghua.

36:33.880 --> 36:35.510
Elder, you've traveled a long way here.

36:35.620 --> 36:36.420
Thank you for your hard work.

36:36.840 --> 36:37.670
It's my duty.

36:38.190 --> 36:40.000
The situation in Yandu is complicated now

36:40.000 --> 36:41.190
and the City Lord has just passed away.

36:41.210 --> 36:42.840
It's necessary for us to come earlier

36:42.840 --> 36:43.920
to make proper preparations.

36:44.590 --> 36:46.400
Now the War Demons are coming with great force.

36:46.730 --> 36:48.210
Zhi Yue has also been plotting for years,

36:48.230 --> 36:49.710
intending to make a move against our clan.

36:49.920 --> 36:51.480
I'm afraid there might be a major incident.

36:51.590 --> 36:52.510
I'll take you immediately

36:52.510 --> 36:53.670
to see the High Priest.

36:54.960 --> 36:56.800
The High Priest is here too?

36:57.070 --> 36:57.880
Yes.

37:00.030 --> 37:01.950
Sir, then I must trouble you

37:02.050 --> 37:03.610
to take them there first.

37:05.550 --> 37:06.480
Elder, aren't you coming

37:06.480 --> 37:07.630
with us?

37:08.190 --> 37:09.280
On my way here,

37:09.320 --> 37:11.190
I've already contacted

37:11.190 --> 37:12.230
an informant in Yandu City.

37:12.230 --> 37:13.360
One of his subordinates

37:13.360 --> 37:14.510
is waiting for me in the south of the city.

37:14.510 --> 37:15.710
He has a detailed map

37:15.710 --> 37:17.800
of the City Lord's Mansion in Yandu.

37:20.440 --> 37:21.630
We should

37:21.870 --> 37:23.580
get a clear understanding first.

37:26.240 --> 37:27.920
As always, Elder, you've thought of everything.

37:29.710 --> 37:31.160
Then I'll go ahead first.

37:50.230 --> 37:51.640
Chief Li Chaoyang.

37:52.970 --> 37:54.300
I've been looking forward to this for a long time.

37:55.150 --> 37:56.590
We've been corresponding for years,

37:56.960 --> 37:57.760
and today

37:58.150 --> 38:00.310
I finally get to see you in person.

38:01.970 --> 38:03.410
It's not I who wants to see you.

38:05.630 --> 38:07.270
It's the god who wants to see you.

38:11.300 --> 38:12.440
[Wushuang Society Secret Manual]

38:21.880 --> 38:23.720
This can't be real.

38:25.710 --> 38:26.670
How can the Wushuang Secret Manual

38:26.670 --> 38:28.360
reappear in the Mortal Realm?

38:29.150 --> 38:30.320
This is impossible.

38:30.810 --> 38:32.040
You must know

38:32.460 --> 38:33.900
if it's real or not.

38:35.280 --> 38:36.070
Master,

38:36.850 --> 38:39.000
would you be willing to help your student?

38:44.100 --> 38:45.580
What do you want me to do?

39:37.880 --> 39:39.440
The weather is so nice today.

39:39.840 --> 39:40.920
The sun isn't too harsh either

39:41.320 --> 39:42.320
and there's no wind.

39:43.360 --> 39:44.920
I'm feeling much better too.

39:45.150 --> 39:46.070
What do you think?

39:47.760 --> 39:48.680
What are you trying to say?

39:50.070 --> 39:51.800
Can't I go with you?

39:54.320 --> 39:55.110
You want to go?

40:04.510 --> 40:05.360
Are you worried about me?

40:07.150 --> 40:08.440
I don't know why,

40:09.400 --> 40:11.070
but I feel uneasy.

40:11.510 --> 40:12.550
After today,

40:13.110 --> 40:14.430
let's leave Yandu.

40:15.110 --> 40:16.030
Where to?

40:19.250 --> 40:20.290
Anywhere.

40:21.190 --> 40:22.510
As long as I'm with you,

40:22.800 --> 40:23.950
anywhere is fine.

41:02.710 --> 41:04.110
In the south, there's a giant beast

41:04.710 --> 41:05.630
called the elephant.

41:06.450 --> 41:07.820
Its body is like a small mountain,

41:08.480 --> 41:09.630
weighing tens of thousands of jin.

41:10.710 --> 41:12.030
I saw one once.

41:13.190 --> 41:15.190
A street performer

41:15.920 --> 41:18.070
used a rope as thin as a pinky

41:18.360 --> 41:19.840
to tie it securely.

41:20.630 --> 41:23.070
He whipped and scolded it,

41:24.150 --> 41:25.760
yet the elephant didn't dare to resist.

41:27.280 --> 41:28.630
I asked the performer,

41:29.680 --> 41:31.150
"This elephant weighs tens of thousands of jin.

41:31.550 --> 41:33.070
Why does it submit to you?"

41:33.670 --> 41:35.030
Guess what he said?

41:35.960 --> 41:37.030
He said this elephant

41:37.680 --> 41:39.510
had been bound by this rope

41:39.850 --> 41:41.220
since it was young.

41:48.760 --> 41:49.550
Qian Lin,

41:50.570 --> 41:52.820
find the rope that binds you

41:53.820 --> 41:54.780
and untie it.

42:17.650 --> 42:20.860
[Yandu City]

42:42.190 --> 42:43.000
Are you alright?

42:43.320 --> 42:44.110
I'm fine.

42:45.720 --> 42:46.720
Here, take this.

42:47.230 --> 42:48.360
Thank you, sir.

42:48.760 --> 42:51.230
My father said there's something big happening in the city today.

42:51.320 --> 42:53.150
No one is allowed to play on the streets.

42:54.710 --> 42:55.880
Then you should hurry home.

42:56.320 --> 42:57.550
You should go home too.
